# Claude Code
.claude/

# macOS
**/.DS_Store

# Defence-in-depth for testing. Showcase content is intentionally plain
# .json + .html (settings.html files include placeholder strings only,
# never real keys), but if a real API key ever ends up pasted into a
# plugin's settings.html while debugging, these lines prevent a stray
# `git add .` from committing it.

# Secrets — keys + credentials
*.jks
*.keystore
**/key.properties
**/local.properties
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/credentials.json
**/google-services.json
**/firebase_config.json
**/firebase-adminsdk*.json

# Build / tooling output
**/build/
**/.gradle/
*.log
*.bak

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
